WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.600
The target ender knocks Ryu down.

2
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.050
Standing medium punch intentionally whiffs during the knockdown.

3
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:01.550
Kimberly dashes into the recorded pressure range.

4
00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.000
Kimberly retreats outside Ryu’s throw attempt.

5
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Standing heavy punch punishes the whiffed throw.

6
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.200
The run-stop heavy-kick target route finishes in Sprint slide.

7
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:06.700
Both fighters have returned to standing after the completed knockdown route.
